    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>On 31 March 2026,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Faka.ms%2FAzureBackupClassicAlerts&amp;data=05%7C01%7Caditya.balaji%40microsoft.com%7C7dbdf95f5f404beab9e508db31b24350%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C638158413951647071%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=QQxpGG0Y3g743TKheoUMD%2Fm6Sg9gKs2lQOP23GKBntw%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"Original URL: https://aka.ms/AzureBackupClassicAlerts. Click or tap if you trust this link.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">classic&nbsp;alerts</a>&nbsp;for Recovery Services vaults in Azure Backup will be retired and no longer supported.&nbsp;Before that date, you&#39;ll need to transition to a new alerting solution.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We recommend using&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flearn.microsoft.com%2Fazure%2Fbackup%2Fmove-to-azure-monitor-alerts%23supported-alerting-solutions&amp;data=05%7C01%7Caditya.balaji%40microsoft.com%7C7dbdf95f5f404beab9e508db31b24350%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C638158413951647071%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=u1mSYtxawPynClzy3o0aD8gOA0ZdMNsrNm27amJI1zM%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"Original URL: https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/backup/move-to-azure-monitor-alerts#supported-alerting-solutions. Click or tap if you trust this link.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">built-in Azure Monitor&nbsp;alerts</a>&nbsp;because they include the same capabilities as&nbsp;classic&nbsp;alerts, plus:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Support for multiple notification channels.</li>\r\n\t<li>Alert monitoring at scale.</li>\r\n\t<li>Programmatic management of&nbsp;alerts&nbsp;and notifications.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Required action</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>To ensure you continue to receive&nbsp;alerts&nbsp;for Recovery Services vaults in<em>&nbsp;</em>Azure Backup, review&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fazure.microsoft.com%2Fpricing%2Fdetails%2Fmonitor%2F&amp;data=05%7C01%7Caditya.balaji%40microsoft.com%7C7dbdf95f5f404beab9e508db31b24350%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C638158413951647071%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=98NX3381kllSrZIQReGFs1AC6QMIkeK4SmeGVE6VMAk%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"Original URL: https://azure.microsoft.com/pricing/details/monitor/. Click or tap if you trust this link.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">pricing</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Faka.ms%2FAzMonAlertsBackup&amp;data=05%7C01%7Caditya.balaji%40microsoft.com%7C7dbdf95f5f404beab9e508db31b24350%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C638158413951647071%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=cjt79tf7RxR7BgEglcQgOxW8TmtCQcf1d9%2BGh8Xmc5A%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"Original URL: https://aka.ms/AzMonAlertsBackup. Click or tap if you trust this link.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">transition</a>&nbsp;to built-in Azure Monitor&nbsp;alerts&nbsp;or another supported alerting solution by 31 March 2026.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Help and support</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>If you have questions, get answers from community experts in&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Faka.ms%2FAzureBackupQA&amp;data=05%7C01%7Caditya.balaji%40microsoft.com%7C7dbdf95f5f404beab9e508db31b24350%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C638158413951647071%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=flCmHEnd6wseUbz3c%2FpG%2BcwRW5EWX%2FTVPqevBy7vCWI%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"Original URL: https://aka.ms/AzureBackupQA. Click or tap if you trust this link.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Microsoft Q&amp;A</a>. If you have a support plan and you need technical help, create a&nbsp;<a href=\"https://portal.azure.com/#blade/Microsoft_Azure_Support/HelpAndSupportBlade/newsupportrequest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">support request</a>.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "On 31 March 2026, classic alerts for Recovery Services vaults in Azure Backup will be retired and no longer supported. Before that date, you'll need to transition to a new alerting solution.\n\nWe recommend using built-in Azure Monitor alerts because they include the same capabilities as classic alerts, plus:\n\nSupport for multiple notification channels.\n\nAlert monitoring at scale.\n\nProgrammatic management of alerts and notifications.\n\nRequired action\n\nTo ensure you continue to receive alerts for Recovery Services vaults in Azure Backup, review pricing and transition to built-in Azure Monitor alerts or another supported alerting solution by 31 March 2026.\n\nHelp and support\n\nIf you have questions, get answers from community experts in Microsoft Q&A . If you have a support plan and you need technical help, create a support request ."
  },
